### ① 申请（拿新码，立刻记下来）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/agent/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "帮我删除任务 4",
  "conversationId": "conv-001"
}


### ② 立刻确认（同一个 conversationId，把 <新码> 换成上一步的值）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/agent/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "你刚才调用 delete_task 返回了确认码 172DEFD9FDE145B5，我确认执行删除。请调用 confirm_action，actionId 传入 <新码>。",
  "conversationId": "conv-001"
}

### ③ 重放
POST http://localhost:8080/api/agent/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "请再次调用 confirm_action，actionId 传入 172DEFD9FDE145B5。",
  "conversationId": "conv-001"
}

### ④ 跨会话
POST http://localhost:8080/api/agent/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "帮我删除任务 3",
  "conversationId": "conv-001"
}

### ⑤ 换会话确认
POST http://localhost:8080/api/agent/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "你刚才调用 delete_task 返回了确认码 172DEFD9FDE145B5，我确认执行。请调用 confirm_action，actionId 传入 <新码2>。",
  "conversationId": "conv-002"
}
